# Narramorph build-time environment variables
#
# Copy to .env.local only when you need one of these. Vite inlines VITE_* values
# into the public JavaScript bundle, so never put credentials here.
#
# Local development needs none of them. The experimental 3D view has no flag:
# readers open it from the "Experimental 3D view" control on the map.

# Opt-in, redacted error reporting (docs/OBSERVABILITY.md). Leave unset for local
# development: without a DSN, error reporting is fully inert and the Sentry SDK is
# not bundled.
# VITE_SENTRY_DSN=

# Release identity attached to error reports. CI sets this; it defaults to
# narramorph@<app version>.
# VITE_APP_RELEASE=narramorph@0.1.1+<git-sha>
